meta {
  name: Coache Groups
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/coaches/groups
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

headers {
  Accept-Language: oz
}

docs {
  Ruxsat etilgan guruhlar ro'yxati — kodni ochib ko'rmasdan bilish uchun.

  Javob:

  ```json
  {
    "groups": ["women", "kids", "women_and_kids"]
  }
  ```

  | Guruh | Ma'nosi |
  |---|---|
  | `women` | faqat ayollar bilan ishlaydigan murabbiy |
  | `kids` | faqat bolalar bilan ishlaydigan murabbiy |
  | `women_and_kids` | ikkisini ham o'z ichiga oladi |

  Shu qiymatlar `create`/`update` body'sida va `list`/`public list`
  `?group=` filtrida ishlatiladi.
}
